The accounts command reads automatic standard input.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight accounts --format json <<'LEDGER'
commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity STOCK
  format 1,000 STOCK
account Assets:Stock
account Assets:Cash
P 2024-01-01 STOCK 12 SEK

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Stock  10 STOCK {10 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -100 SEK
LEDGER

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  "Assets:Cash",
  "Assets:Stock"
]
